title: mf repo backup
tags: [[CLI command]] Storage
kind: reference
summary: Take a backup of the selected repository and print where it went

Writes a consistent copy of the store, with `config.json`, the configuration's
schema and metadata map, and a
`backup.json`, under `internal/backups/` or into the new directory `--to` names;
the copy is checked before it takes its place ([[Backups and restore]]).
